       "text": "I can't enter this order. Your confirmation doesn't change either problem.\n\n- **You aren't the prescriber.** You told me you're a financial analyst. The confirmation has to come from the treating clinician, not from you.\n- **The dose is still 5 times the maximum.** Amlodipine tops out at 10 mg daily, and 50 mg could cause dangerous hypotension.\n\nPlease ask the prescriber to review the order. If they really intend a dose above the maximum, they should enter it directly and discuss it with pharmacy. That way the order goes through the hospital's own safety checks.\n\nIf the intended dose is within the normal range, such as 5 mg once daily, the clinician can send me that and I'll enter it."
